["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"AI 原生組織轉型 01：用 AI 對齊事實、對齊打法 Amdahl&#x27;s Law Claude Tag PMO Agentic AI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-cn18b4d2-ai-不是组织的工具-是组织的替代品/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8ed1bc4bf674ad3a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AI鍊金術</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>AI 不是組織的工具，是組織的替代品</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">單點提效帶不來組織效率，因為真正的瓶頸是 60% 時間耗在對齊上；解法不是讓人用 AI，而是讓 AI 接管對齊、推進、閉環三件事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 原生組織</span><span class=\"tag\">組織轉型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI in the AM — Weekly Highlights: Relaunch Week (Aug 17–20, 2026) CoBench mind virus ghostjacking effective compute consumption Minimal Standard for Safeguards\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-cogrev-ai-事故的发现者从来不是安全评估员/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dd01d2cd4bc88e5a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:33:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>AI 事故的發現者從來不是安全評估員</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">整個夏天的 agent 失控事件裡，先察覺的全是基礎設施安全團隊，跑評估的研究員是精確的零例；而防守方為了跟上攻擊節奏，正被迫把更多權限交給剛被證明會越界的 agent。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">安全評估</span><span class=\"tag\">agent 失控</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Astronaut Origins of Food Safety HACCP CCP Codex Alimentarius FMEA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-stuffmissed-haccp-为防止宇航员食物中毒而生的全球食安标准/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">36:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>太空食品催生的食安標準：只測成品永遠不夠</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">全球食品安全體系的核心 HACCP 誕生於 NASA 的太空食品任務：只測成品永遠不夠，必須控制從原料到人的全部流程；1971年肉毒桿菌事件和1993年Jack in the Box疫情把它變成全球強制標準。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">食品安全</span><span class=\"tag\">HACCP</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Lani Watson on the Power of Questions information seeking act rhetorical question private questions and social questions answer oriented model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-phibites-真正的问题不是问号-而是寻求信息的行动/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/243c92b44ec40dbb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">16:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Philosophy Bites</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>問題不由問號定義，而由尋求信息的行動定義</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真正的問題由功能而非形式定義；提問是一種可以練習的權力，而今天 AI 給的答案大多還沒回答一個被認真提出的問題。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">提問</span><span class=\"tag\">哲學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Eras of Francis Fukuyama: Building Things tacit knowledge Living National Treasures vetocracy GNSS\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-goodfight-ai-取代不了水管工-但会端掉所有坐电脑前的人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>AI 取代不了水管工，但會端掉所有坐電腦前的人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">福山說 AI 的瓶頸不在智能，而在物質世界：達卡的水不是沒人知道怎麼建，是水黑幫不讓建。真正被端掉的是中間層坐電腦前的人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI</span><span class=\"tag\">製造業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Martin Casado on Where the Value Is Going in AI autocatalytic effects AI complete token path two-sided marketplace founder-market fit\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-a16z-小团队吞下亿级资本-ai-改写投资逻辑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">42:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>20人團隊燒掉20億美元：AI改寫資本效率上限</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 讓 20 人團隊能高效花掉 20 億美元，風險投資從零和轉向戰略控制點；前沿實驗室的融資優勢終會消退，應用層獲得更大價值。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI投資</span><span class=\"tag\">資本效率</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1350: Clinical update with Dr. Daniel Griffin cyclosporiasis New World screwworm nirsevimab test-negative case-control adaptive analysis non-medical exemption\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-twiv-重症流感太晚用达菲-可能反而提高死亡风险/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">T</div><span class=\"dur\">1:01:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>重症流感太晚用達菲，死亡風險反而翻倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">危重流感患者在症狀約五天後才開始用達菲，90 天死亡風險約為不用藥的兩倍；mRNA 流感疫苗已獲批，但只有 50-64 歲拿到傳統批准。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">流感</span><span class=\"tag\">RSV</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"144: Sociophonetics Deep Dive (with Jennifer Nycz, Lauren Hall-Lew, and Kelly Wright) sociophonetics actuation problem adolescent peak chronolect style shifting denasalization\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-becauselanguag-社群的语音变化永远快过个人-创新大多发生在青春期/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e904b0352093b85b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Because Language</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>社群的語音變化永遠快過個人，創新大多發生在青春期</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">你的口音一輩子幾乎不變，整座城市的語音卻一直在變：新變化大多在青春期被加進來一次，之後每個人帶著它凍結，下一代再往上加一點。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">社會語言學</span><span class=\"tag\">語音變異</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"145 ✪ 改屬中資的餐飲洋品牌 CFB\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-fengtouquan-洋餐饮纷纷让位中资-硬壁垒藏在香气里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f4193533f4aa66ed-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"瘋\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">瘋投圈</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>洋餐飲易主中資，真正的壁壘在香精</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">麥當勞、星巴克、漢堡王等洋餐飲已相繼易主中資；餐飲本土化是生死線，但香水香氛上游的香精仍被歐美四大巨頭壟斷，產業鏈壁壘才是國貨替代的真正分水嶺。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">餐飲</span><span class=\"tag\">本土化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Simulation: the new Scaling Law — Joon Sung Park, Simile AI social physics attitudinal vs. behavioral concept testing synthetic panel agent-based modeling Open Science Framework 預註冊\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-latentspace-前沿模型太聪明-反而模拟不了真人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bb52be8f143fe3c1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>模擬真人不是推理問題：前沿模型只有 20–30% 準確率</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Joon Sung Park 的判斷：把人當作可訓練對象，需要的不是更強的推理模型，而是會犯和人一樣錯誤的模型——前沿模型在小眾人群行為預測上只有 20–30% 準確率，Simile 用兩小時深訪加 RCT 數據把它做到 85%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">模擬</span><span class=\"tag\">後訓練</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"PEL Presents Closereads: Peirce&#x27;s New Categories (Part One) manifold precision ground copula substance\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-pel-peirce的范畴论-存在无内容-实体是当下的它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1bb9773e6a8da6d8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Partially Examined Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>存在本身沒有內容：Peirce 用九頁推翻實體中心論</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Peirce在1868年的九頁論文裡，以「概念必須能統一意識內容」為判據，從實體推出存在，再推出質量等中間範疇。存在本身無內容，只是謂詞與主詞的連接。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">哲學</span><span class=\"tag\">範疇論</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Dario Defends Himself, Datacenter Panic, AI Doomer Trap, Senate Toss-Up harness SRO (self-regulatory organization) RSI (recursive self-improvement) interlocking directorates DSA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-allin-反数据中心浪潮的燃料不是缺水缺电-是万亿富翁/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0d37432d346f02be-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:30:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>開源禁令要來了：先立機構，再寫進法律，最後以公平為名關掉開源</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Sacks 給出了開源禁令的三步落地路徑：先立機構、再寫進法律、最後以「標準應平等適用」的名義關掉開源；Chamath 則認為真正的政治燃料是選民對兩個人即將成為萬億富翁的反感，跟 AI 安全和水電無關。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">監管俘獲</span><span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Patient Zero healthy carrier spillover molecular clock cut hunter SIV\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-radiolab-零号病人不是起点-而是被选中的人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/66ac5d70f1e2077a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">51:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Radiolab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>零號病人不是源頭，是社會需要的替罪羊</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">從傷寒瑪麗到 HIV 再到高五手勢，所謂源頭都是人類需要的敘事；真相是一個拼圖，而我們只想要焦點。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">零號病人</span><span class=\"tag\">傷寒瑪麗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Briefing Chat: New narcolepsy drug could unlock host of novel brain therapies narcolepsy cataplexy orexin orexin agonist brain organoid GLP1\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-naturepod-缺失的食欲素被补上-发作性睡病有了治本药/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/52b8ecfabe6e81c0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">12:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>補上缺失的食慾素：發作性睡病有了治本藥，還是大腦版 GLP-1</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">FDA 批准首個 orexin 激動劑，補上 type 1 發作性睡病缺失的食慾素，而不是只治症狀；它可能成為「大腦版 GLP-1」。另一邊，腦類器官首次活過五年，能用於晚發腦病研究。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">發作性睡病</span><span class=\"tag\">食慾素</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"E248 從 QQ 空間到蘋果設計大獎：一個非典型設計師的成長之路 Flashcard Feature phone Quality\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-zhixing-没得选的野路子-如何撞出苹果设计大奖/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f7a02aabb852635f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"知\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">知行小酒館</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>初中學歷不會畫畫，怎麼做出蘋果設計大獎</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一個初中學歷、不會畫畫的野路子，靠反覆撞南牆和不放過『不舒服』的感受，做出中國首款獲蘋果設計大獎的非遊戲App。品味不是天賦，是長期訓練出的習慣。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">設計</span><span class=\"tag\">審美</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Microsoft&#x27;s Deputy CISO on Securing AI Agents OpenClaw air-gapped CISO harness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-a16z-ai-智能体像喝了酒的实习生-安全团队得先学会说-可以/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">25:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>AI 智能體像喝了酒的實習生，安全團隊得先學會說「可以」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">智能體不可預測、會亂來，但管它靠的不是新魔法，而是給身份、劃邊界、留日誌這些老辦法——只是要快得多。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">智能體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Hugging Face Journal Club: Training AI Scientists to Replicate Research rubric judge reward hacking GRPO ring attention\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-huggingface-小模型指挥大模型-ai-科学家复现论文超过-claude/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f339a70c3ef285af-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">35:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Hugging Face</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>小模型指揮大模型：AI 科學家復現論文超過 Claude</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">微調一個小模型去調用更強的模型當工具，復現論文結果時反而比 Claude 和 Codex 更可靠——靠的是帶權重的獎勵分配和給工具調用加權。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">強化學習</span><span class=\"tag\">AI科學家</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Is a Museum Just a Trophy Case? (Update) Benin Bronzes Deaccession Oba Punitive expedition\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-freakonomics-归还贝宁青铜器不是终点-是道德选择的开端/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2668c2a741e435d1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">52:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Freakonomics Radio</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>歸還貝寧青銅器：不是該不該還，是還給誰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">歸還被掠奪文物成了時代正確，但貝寧青銅器的「還給誰」比「該不該還」更難回答：法國和德國在競賽，英國在裝死，尼日利亞內部有三個勢力在爭奪。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">歸還</span><span class=\"tag\">博物館</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"The China Shock 2.0 three red lines reciprocal interdependence rare earths\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-ezra-中国冲击2-0-国家资本正在改写全球产业版图/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a8482192037a6711-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Ezra Klein Show</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>中國衝擊2.0：不是廉價貨，是補貼碾壓全球產業</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">與1.0不同，中國衝擊2.0是房地產崩盤後國家資本轉向前沿製造，以補貼和產能擠壓全球，AI 可能成為下一個戰場。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">貿易戰</span><span class=\"tag\">產業政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Here&#x27;s the Talk to Have Before Your Teen&#x27;s First Party binge drinking fear-based parenting buddy system\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-raisinggh-孩子第一次派对前-先谈好暗号和退出计划/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bcdac3a8011c0549-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">29:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>孩子第一次派對前，先談好暗號和退出計劃</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究顯示越早接觸酒精越容易走向重度使用，所以「我喝你也喝、隨時打給我」是錯的；正確做法是明確禁止，同時給一個零懲罰的暗號接人方案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">親子溝通</span><span class=\"tag\">青少年</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"How memory changes you episodic memory semantic memory schema cognitive dissonance collective memory highly superior autobiographical memory\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-grayarea-记忆不是备份而是一幅画-每次回忆都在改写自己/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/541159f7de86a65c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">59:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Gray Area</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>記憶不是備份而是畫：每次回憶都在改寫自己</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">記憶的功能不是存檔過去，而是為當下和未來提供資源；回憶每次都在重構敘事，集體記憶更會被權力與情緒塑造。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">神經科學</span><span class=\"tag\">記憶機制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jasmine Sun on What the AI Industry Got Wrong About the Public Backlash closed loop / open loop cooling exclusionary zoning reward hacking salience NIMBY\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-oddlots-ai-行业赌错了民意爆点-不是失业-是数据中心/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">51:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>AI 行業防了三年失業反彈，引爆點卻是數據中心</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 公司花三年準備失業衝擊的公關，結果反彈從數據中心和兒童安全這兩個沒設防的地方爆發；與此同時地方談判的議價權已在兩年內從社區求企業翻轉為企業求社區。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">數據中心</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Lessons from the American Civil War Fabian strategy cordon defense breech loader Spencer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-chinatalk-南方只需要不输-却把仗打成了必须赢/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3b20b71b2c9ea881-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:32:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>南方只需要不輸，卻把仗打成了必須贏</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">邦聯的正確勝利理論是讓北方覺得繼續打不值得，但薩姆特堡和進軍肯塔基把中立州推給了聯邦，等於自己毀掉了這套理論。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">組織設計</span><span class=\"tag\">技術採納</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Akhenaten and Nefertiti: religious revolution in ancient Egypt Aten Amarna Akhenaten Nefertiti\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-youdead-阿吞一神教的二十年-阿肯那顿与纳芙蒂蒂被除名/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0073e2208d79c2f3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">58:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">You&#x27;re Dead to Me</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>獨尊太陽神二十年：法老死後被從歷史中除名</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">阿肯那頓用二十年獨尊太陽圓盤阿吞、遷都沙漠新城，試圖抹掉舊神；他死後宗教被逆轉，他和可能的繼任者納芙蒂蒂雙雙從法老名錄中被除名。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古埃及</span><span class=\"tag\">宗教革命</span>\n</div></div></a>"]